ind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Here!","summary":"Not every adventure begins with a royal coronation. But this one does. And it comes with court intrigue, potential romance, turn-based battles, and a goose that won’t cooperate.The free demo of Wayfar: Crown’s Call is now available on Steam!Join the protagonist and his friend as they step into the world of Sclavinia, meet its people, and try to prevent a conflict between two kingdoms.Ready to see what awaits beyond the coronation?Play the demo:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:12:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681640","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4609780-1846018067933582","game_id":"steam-4609780","kind":"announcement","title":"Join the Playtest on October 10","summary":"Join the playtest starting October 10 and take part in a memorable coronation, try to keep two kingdoms from going to war, meet companions with their own stories, and face a fierce goose that has no intention of becoming anyone's dinner.There's also room for romance: charm the locals and see just how far your charisma can take you.Expect story-driven dialogues, side quests, and turn-based battles featuring action points and elemental weaknesses. Atmospheric acoustic music accompanies your journe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T14:57:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933582","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4609780-1835236783557518","game_id":"steam-4609780","kind":"announcement","title":"Wayfar: Crown’s Call is Now on Steam","summary":"Hello everyone.We’re happy to finally reveal Wayfar: Crown’s Call, our story-driven fantasy RPG set in the world of Sclavinia.The game follows former chosen warriors who lost their divine power after the death of the tsar. Now they are drawn back into a struggle for the future of the crown.Expect a fantasy journey with turn-based battles, companions, folk-tale atmosphere, and a card-inspired visual style that shapes how the world is shown.Our first trailer is now live, and the Steam page is open","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-10T13:11:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783557518","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4609780":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:02Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:01Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4609780":"2026-10-26T03:15:02Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4609780":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5125640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4609780","app_id":4609780,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:42Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"3d13123b31657c808b74aab5b6fcc50f8bff3a6d04d70a1627cfbef4e8406026","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"고대 설화와 궁정의 음모, 수수께끼 같은 영웅들이 살아 숨 쉬는 스클라비니아에서 포근한 RPG 모험을 시작하세요. 세계를 누비고 괴물과 싸우며 동료들과 가까워진 뒤, 누구에게 마음을… 그리고 한 민족의 운명을 맡길지 결정하세요.","publishers":[{"name":"-"}],"developers":[{"name":"Lock On Games"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message